         listed here - matching the existing, unlisted Compono.AotSmokeTest/Compono.TUnit.AotSmokeTest/
         Compono.TestDoubles.AotSmokeTest convention: a manual, one-shot PublishAot proof driven by
         its own pack-compono.sh + dotnet publish, not part of `dotnet build Compono.slnx`. The two
         AnalyzerContract/ projects are additionally EXPECTED to produce IL2026/IL3050 warnings by
         design (one of them), which would violate this repo's 0-warnings-0-errors build discipline
         if included in the normal solution-wide build. Compono.Logging.AotSmokeTest (PLAN-0055 task
         15) follows this exact same convention and is likewise deliberately unlisted. -->
